{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p id=\"p-rc_3c99b8457afa4eab-1610\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>呂慧儀（阿蟹）向來是圈中的模範媽媽，不時抽空陪伴兒子「蟹籽」玩樂，享受溫馨的親子時光。日前阿蟹在社交網分享兩母子出外遊玩的照片，並感性發文：「工作忙碌的時候，總要充充電。我的充電方法是：重看快樂時光的照片❤️。」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_3c99b8457afa4eab-1610\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"ad510f57-1b84-4983-9ec0-3ed271b258bb.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/20262xthdBcHCU1790155117.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"ad510f57-1b84-4983-9ec0-3ed271b258bb.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c2a746fd-faff-41e4-a0c2-da19b65473de.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026qZZn29ZkEB1790155117.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c2a746fd-faff-41e4-a0c2-da19b65473de.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p id=\"p-rc_3c99b8457afa4eab-1611\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>片中可見，「蟹籽」特意帶上畢業袍在外國拍照留念，阿蟹亦帶兒子前往動物園觀賞各式各樣的動物。過程中最搞笑的是，當「蟹籽」見到企鵝時，對著鏡頭天真地說：「媽咪，海洋公園嘅企鵝嚟咗呢度呀！」</span></p><h3 style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></h3><p style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_3c99b8457afa4eab-1612\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>之後，當他看見科莫多龍時，更即時興奮高呼：「金城安嗰隻 Bonnie！」全程非常開心觀賞動物，兩母子度過了十分快樂的時光。阿蟹隨後發文：「早前去旅行的時候，去了動物園，重遇了小 Bon，蟹籽好開心！😆喜歡動物，可以看完整條片喔！🥰我又去努力 study 咯！」</span></p><p id=\"p-rc_3c99b8457afa4eab-1612\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><p id=\"p-rc_3c99b8457afa4eab-1612\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"6533bc4d-c9a2-43b1-a764-c23f0aa51c95.png.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026H1oGUkefby1790155116.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"6533bc4d-c9a2-43b1-a764-c23f0aa51c95.png.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p id=\"p-rc_3c99b8457afa4eab-1613\" style='text-align: left; font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif !important; line-height: 1.15 !important; margin-top: 0px !important; margin-left: 0px !important; margin-right: 0px !important;'><span style='font-family: \"Google Sans Text\", sans-serif;'>帖文曝光後獲得不少網民讚好，有粉絲更熱烈留言笑指：「蟹籽好可愛🤭⋯⋯小 Bon 係動物，點解會變咗 Bonnie 嘅😂🤣😜。但他同我們一樣入咗血喎😝！去到邊一見到就可以隨時講出劇中故事🔥都是熊家人留給我們的最好紀念。」</span></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T09:39:35.077029+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":440,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}